{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clash of Melodies</strong> is a Visual Novel Rhythm Game, set in a high fantasy world. It's telling the story of two dorks who don't like each other going on an adventure together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features <strong>two rhythm game modes</strong>: One <strong>DDR / FNF inspired</strong>\u00a0&quot;<strong>Arrow&quot; Mode</strong>, and an <strong>original &quot;Circle&quot; Mode,</strong> in which you have to catch the incoming note with a circle in the middle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond that, the story is told through classic visual novel style text cutscenes, as well as a few fully animated sequences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have beaten a stage in the story, you can go for a highscore and a full combo in <strong>Freeplay.</strong> There you can also choose a <strong>hard mode</strong> that keeps a separate score.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640990?t=1772621416","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640990?t=1772621416","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640990/1e0e174aa188a3440658d37f358d15a19ecec8c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772621416","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640990/1e0e174aa188a3440658d37f358d15a19ecec8c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772621416","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3647710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clash of Melodies</strong> is a Visual Novel Rhythm Game, set in a high fantasy world. It's telling the story of two dorks who don't like each other going on an adventure together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features <strong>two rhythm game modes</strong>: One <strong>DDR / FNF inspired</strong>\u00a0&quot;<strong>Arrow&quot; Mode</strong>, and an <strong>original &quot;Circle&quot; Mode,</strong> in which you have to catch the incoming note with a circle in the middle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond that, the story is told through classic visual novel style text cutscenes, as well as a few fully animated sequences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have beaten a stage in the story, you can go for a highscore and a full combo in <strong>Freeplay.</strong> There you can also choose a <strong>hard mode</strong> that keeps a separate score.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Sini"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640990/2925fd90b49a2ebb1495ea11022957d286daf9f8/header.jpg?t=1772621416","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3640990/866240/a8b3a37dcf6e53997cfbe3f3515e1e4125a790c2/1750409703/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744298009","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3640990/866240/a8b3a37dcf6e53997cfbe3f3515e1e4125a790c2/1750409703/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744298009","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3640990/866240/a8b3a37dcf6e53997cfbe3f3515e1e4125a790c2/1750409703/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744298009","id":257123748,"name":"Basic Overview Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123748/81836a80c1fe4f358f4db96602e9f091dbe9b080/movie_600x337.jpg?t=174429